From 2a121b51e47dd53b9f0935c17ce563f92a0fb932 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Code Review <review@local>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 14:27:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Reframe navigation and dashboard around the 3-stage journey
 (Prepare / Apply / Advance)

Navigation (AppLayout):
- Group pages into numbered journey stages: 1. Prepare (Profile & Portfolio,
  Voice Studio, Resume), 2. Apply (Jobs, AI Optimizer), 3. Advance
  (Applications, Career & Learning), plus Resources
- Stage hints ('Set up once', 'Repeat per role', 'Track & grow') so the flow
  is self-explanatory; remove ad-hoc drag-to-reorder in favor of the
  intentional flow

Dashboard:
- Replace the new-user-only checklist and quick links with an always-on
  journey map: three stage cards with live progress bars and item checklists
  driven by real data (active profile, resume, voice, jobs, applications,
  interviews, learning items)
- Each stage surfaces a single next best action computed from state
- Stats row and match-rate ring retained

No route changes; existing URLs and redirects keep working.
